{"id":"00053","root":"uni00053_1","name":{"ja":"スネークレディ","en":"Snake Lady"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"スネークレディ","en":"Snake Lady"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Poisoner","Nomad"],"release":"2018-11-16","limited":false,"characterId":46,"profile":{"ja":"本名はカリヤ。カオス・アリーナの人気戦士。ふたなりの美女。あたりはやわらかい印象だが、微笑みながら平気で残酷なことをする。実は魔界の住人でそれもかなり高位の存在。蛇神ナーガ族の３人の族長の一人で、インドでは「カーリヤ」とも呼ばれて祭られているほど。エドウィン・ブラックの親友であり、彼に匹敵する力を持つ。享楽的で淫蕩な性格で、人間たちに混じりとくに目的もなくカオス・アリーナの戦士として遊んでいるといった感じ。ちなみにナーガ族の別の族長は「タクシャカ」「ヴァースキ」。","en":"Kaliya, whose real name is Kaliya, is a popular warrior of the Chaos Arena and a beautiful futanari. She gives a soft impression, but she smiles while casually committing cruelty. In truth she is a high-ranking resident of the Demon Realm, one of the three chieftains of the serpent-god Naga tribe, and is even worshipped in India as \"Kaliya.\" She is a close friend of Edwin Black and possesses power comparable to his. She has a hedonistic, lewd personality and mingles among humans without any particular purpose, simply enjoying herself as a Chaos Arena fighter. For reference, the other Naga chieftains are Takshaka and Vasuki."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"佐倉もも花","forms":[{"id":"uni00053_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1104,2208],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[164,328],"def":[154,308],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","50001"]},{"id":"uni00053_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1608,3216],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[253,506],"def":[233,466],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","50001","50002"]},{"id":"uni00053_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2112,4225],"sp":[300,300],"atk":[342,685],"def":[312,623],"spd":[56,56],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["2","50001","50002","50003"]}],"skills":{"2":{"slot":"attack","id":2,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"魔性属性ダメージ"}},{"